ished":"2009-03-12T15:20:50.063","updated":"2026-06-16T23:06:02.000","remediation":"立即将 FileZilla Server 升级至 0.9.31 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SSL/TLS 数据包处理中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在服务器防火墙中禁用 TLS/SSL 端口（默认 990）或限制可信 IP 访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://filezilla-project.org/index.php","http://secunia.com/advisories/34089","http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=665428","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/34006","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1021812","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2009/0603","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/49107","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0884.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/490586283f9ca1596471e5230c91d74f96495bb9/network/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0884.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0046a45cb220e45d345b72de014f969fbf07f97c/cves/2009/0xxx/CVE-2009-0884.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-0884","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/c0901c5feaea7671258580515c5866cd13c6b804/reports/network/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0884.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d64fd6053930ee34fd56cc0cd403ec7e8d566761/CVE/data/2009/CVE-2009-0884.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2009-0884_4.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2009-0884.yaml","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2009-0884.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/filezilla_server_0931.nasl","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/eb5b8eb0660680345d7e7dcdd38efdec9e726c7b/advisories/2022/05/EUVD-2009-0881.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0024","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-0781","title":"Apache Tomcat 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 示例 Web 应用中的日历组件 jsp/cal/cal2.jsp 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于对用户提交的 time 参数未进行充分输入过滤和输出编码，导致攻击者可构造恶意 URL 诱导用户访问，从而在受害者浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 4.1.0 至 4.1.39、5.5.0 至 5.5.27 以及 6.0.0 至 6.0.18 版本，CVSS 评分 4.3（中危），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度中等，需用户交互但无需认证，成功利用可窃取会话 Cookie、篡改页面内容或发起进一步攻击。Apache Tomcat 已在后续版本中修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或删除示例应用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0781"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2009-03-09T21:30:00.217","updated":"2026-06-16T23:05:48.120","remediation":"建议升级 Apache Tomcat 至 4.1.40、5.5.28、6.0.19 或更高版本。若暂时无法升级，请删除 Tomcat 安装目录下的 webapps/examples 目录（含 cal2.jsp 示例应用），或在 web.xml 中移除该示例应用的 servlet 映射，防止攻击者利用 cal2.jsp 的 time 参数注入 XSS 攻击代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2010//Mar/msg00001.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2009-07/msg00002.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=127420533226623&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=129070310906557&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=133469267822771&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=136485229118404&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/35685","http://secunia.com/advisories/35788","http://secunia.com/advisories/37460","http://secunia.com/advisories/42368","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-26-263529-1","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT4077","http://tomcat.apache.org/security-4.html","http://tomcat.apache.org/security-5.html","http://tomcat.apache.org/security-6.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2207","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2009:136","http://www.mandriva.com/se