2009-0238"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2009-02-25T16:30:00.343","updated":"2026-06-16T23:04:33.880","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS09-017 对应更新：Excel 2000 安装 KB969683、Excel 2002 安装 KB969679、Excel 2003 安装 KB969680、Excel 2007 安装 KB969462；Excel Viewer 升级至最新版；Office for Mac 2004 安装 KB969681、2008 安装 KB969682。无法打补丁时使用 MOICE（Microsoft Office Isolated Converter Environment）打开未知来源 Excel 文件作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blogs.zdnet.com/security/?p=2658","http://isc.sans.org/diary.html?storyid=5923","http://securitytracker.com/id?1021744","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/security/advisory/968272.mspx","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/33870","http://www.symantec.com/business/security_response/writeup.jsp?docid=2009-022310-4202-99","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA09-104A.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2009/1023","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2009/ms09-009","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/48875","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A5968","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2009-0238","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2009/CVE-2009-0238.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2009/0xxx/CVE-2009-0238.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-0238","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2009/0xxx/CVE-2009-0238.json","https://github.com/MahdiHedhli/threatpedia/blob/9c95c1bcbb7ff89eda6c0a2154702b1ad72592e4/site/src/content/zero-days/microsoft-office-cve-2009-0238.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/nvd_advisories/CVE-2009-0238.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2009-0238.html","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2009/CVE-2009-0238.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2009/CVE-2009-0238.md","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/df98cd885e49b66ef39b05ac11ddad1b492edabf/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0019","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-0040","title":"libpng 拒绝服务代码执行漏洞","description":"libpng PNG 参考库在 1.0.43 之前版本及 1.2.35 之前的 1.2.x 版本中存在未初始化指针释放漏洞。攻击者可通过构造恶意 PNG 文件，在 png_read_png 函数处理、pCAL 块处理或 16 位伽马表设置过程中触发未初始化指针释放，导致应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务）或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用受影响 libpng 版本的所有应用程序（如 pngcrush 等图像处理工具），CVSS 6.8（中等严重度），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度中等，无需认证，可造成部分机密性、完整性和可用性影响。攻击者需诱导受害者打开或处理特制 PNG 文件才能触发漏洞。升级至 libpng 1.0.43 或 1.2.35 及以上版本可修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0040"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2009-02-22T22:30:00.203","updated":"2026-06-16T23:04:08.857","remediation":"建议立即升级 libpng 至 1.0.43 版本（1.0.x 分支）或 1.2.35 版本（1.2.x 分支）及以上版本。通过包管理器更新：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install libpng12-0`，RHEL/CentOS 执行 `yum update libpng`，或从 libpng 官网下载源码编译安装。如无法立即升级，请在应用层限制处理不可信 PNG 文件，或部署应用层 WAF 规则拦截异常 PNG 块结构作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://downloads.sourceforge.net/libpng/libpng-1.2.34-ADVISORY.txt","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2009/Aug/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2009/Jun/msg00005.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2009/May/msg00002.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2009/jun/msg00002.html","h