9List 动作的 type 参数中注入 shell 元字符，触发任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 ZeroShell 1.0beta11 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前官方尚未发布补丁，建议限制相关页面的网络访问。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0545"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2009-02-12T23:30:01.170","updated":"2026-06-16T23:05:16.320","remediation":"升级至 ZeroShell 1.0beta12 或更高版本；若无法升级，对 1.0beta11 应用官方补丁 C100（zeroshell.net/eng/patch-details/#C100）；临时缓解措施：在防火墙或反向代理层限制对 /cgi-bin/kerbynet 的未授权访问，并对 web 管理控制台启用 IP 白名单或 HTTP 认证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ikkisoft.com/stuff/LC-2009-01.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/500763/100/0/threaded","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2009/0385","http://www.zeroshell.net/eng/announcements/","http://www.zeroshell.net/eng/patch-details/#C100","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/8023","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0545.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2009/CVE-2009-0545.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/490586283f9ca1596471e5230c91d74f96495bb9/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0545.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2009-0545-1407.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2009-0545.js","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-0545_%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2009-0545-1402.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/ac9605f5a915670fd80cb4e1904f4435f1835b65/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2009-0545-1405.yaml","https://github.com/cristianovisk/cves_data_intelligence/blob/a227a6d4eb587f5f63e576bb52bd153b254c12e4/honeypots/2009/CVE-2009-0545.json","https://github.com/u21h2/nacs/blob/1eaa239ded7496317a47073605c8ddda70686ef5/web/poc/pocs/nuclei/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0545.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Oct/30/Artifact/Report.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0023","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-0376","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"这是一个影响 RealPlayer 的堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过精心构造的 Internet Video Recording (IVR) 文件触发。漏洞存在于 RealPlayer 运行时 DLL 文件中，由于对特定字段长度控制不足导致堆 corruption，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 10 至 11.0.4 版本、RealPlayer Enterprise、Mac RealPlayer 10/10.1、Linux RealPlayer 10 及 Helix Player 10.x 等多个平台和操作系统。攻击者无需身份验证，只需向目标发送恶意 IVR 文件即可利用此漏洞，攻击过程可能通过 Windows Explorer 插件完成。漏洞 CVSS 评分高达 9.3，攻击者可完全控制受影响系统，窃取敏感数据或安装恶意软件。攻击者还可能通过邮件附件、网络共享或其他文件传输方式传播恶意 IVR 文件。RealNetworks 已发布安全补丁，升级到 RealPlayer SP 1.0.5 或更高版本可修复此漏洞。用户应及时更新 RealPlayer 到最新安全版本，以防止此类威胁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0376"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2009-02-08T21:30:09.813","updated":"2026-06-16T23:04:53.960","remediation":"建议立即升级至 RealPlayer SP 1.0.5 或更高版本（RealPlayer 11.0.5+、RealPlayer Enterprise 2.0+、Mac RealPlayer 10.1.1+、Linux RealPlayer 10.0.1+、Helix Player 10.1+）。若暂时无法升级，可在 Windows 资源管理器中取消 .ivr 文件关联，或在防火墙层面禁止 RealPlayer 访问网络，禁用 RealPlayer 浏览器插件作为临时缓解措施。Windows 用户可通过“控制面板 → 程序 → 默认程序 → 设置关联”取消 .ivr 关联；Linux/Mac 用户可删除或重命名 RealPlayer 浏览器插件文件（如 /usr/lib/mozilla/plugins/nphelix*.so）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/33810","http://secunia.com/advisories/38218","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/01192010_player/en/","http://www.fortiguardcenter.com/advisory/FGA-2009-04.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/500722/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.c