.1、Linux 10 及 Helix Player 10.x）在处理 Internet Video Recording (IVR) 文件时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可构造文件名长度字段包含巨大整数的恶意 IVR 文件，诱导用户通过 Windows 资源管理器插件打开，触发任意内存位置被 0x00 字节覆盖，导致任意代码远程执行。漏洞影响 Windows、Mac、Linux 多平台多版本 RealPlayer 及 Helix Player，CVSS 9.3 严重级别，攻击者需诱导用户打开恶意文件即可实现远程代码执行，RealNetworks 已发布 RealPlayer SP 1.0.5 修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0375"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2009-02-08T21:30:09.797","updated":"2026-06-16T23:04:53.820","remediation":"立即升级 RealPlayer 至 SP 1.0.5 或更高版本（RealPlayer 11.0.5+、RealPlayer 10.5 6.0.12.1742+、RealPlayer 10 修补版）。无法立即升级时，在 Windows 资源管理器中取消关联 .ivr 文件，或卸载 RealPlayer Windows Explorer 插件（卸载 ivfsrc.ax 过滤器），禁止打开不可信的 IVR 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/33810","http://secunia.com/advisories/38218","http://service.real.com/realplayer/security/01192010_player/en/","http://www.fortiguardcenter.com/advisory/FGA-2009-04.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/500722/100/0/threaded","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/33652","http://www.vupen.com/english/advisories/2010/0178","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/48567","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2009/0xxx/CVE-2009-0375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2009/CVE-2009-0375","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2009-0375.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2009/CVE-2009-0375.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-x474-4899-v7hv/GHSA-x474-4899-v7hv.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2009/gb_realplayer_ivr_mult_vuln.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/realplayer_12_0_0_319.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_115300_115400.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x34000/33652/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2009/AVE-2009-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2009-0001","file_name":"2009/AVE-2009-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2009-0347","title":"Autonomy Ultraseek cs.html 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Autonomy (原 Verity) Ultraseek 搜索引擎的 cs.html 页面存在开放重定向漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 url 参数传入恶意构造的外部链接，诱使用户访问该参数的 URL，从而将用户重定向至任意第三方网站，配合钓鱼攻击窃取敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Autonomy Ultraseek 相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中危。攻击可在未认证条件下远程发起，利用复杂度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2009-0347"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2009-01-29T19:30:00.377","updated":"2026-06-16T23:04:49.807","remediation":"联系 Autonomy 官方技术支持获取修复了 cs.html 开放重定向漏洞的 Ultraseek 更新版本；如无法及时升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截包含 /cs.html?url= 路径的 HTTP 请求作为临时缓解措施，同时应对 url 参数传入的目标域名进行白名单校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunbeltblog.blogspot.com/2009/01/constant-stream-of-ultraseek-redirects.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/202753","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/33500","http://www.ultraseek.com/forums/thread.jspa?messageID=9818","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/48336","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/32766","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2009/CVE-2009-0347.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/a90de4f84b4783951362f491671e1e9decfc17cb/2009/CVE-2009-0347.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/a8dd65f3bd9f09